# name: udf/RealUdfsOutOfProcess.test
# description: Real Python UDFs from papers, open-source projects, database and streaming systems (nes-python-udf/benchmark/real-udfs) as EXECUTION OUT_OF_PROCESS UDFs, with the results of CPython. Generated by nes-python-udf/benchmark/real-udfs/gen_systest.py.
# groups: [PythonUdf, PythonUdfProcess, RealUdfs]

# databases/bigquery_docs_get_bucket
